  This is not an adopted release citation.
type: software
title: CoPuzzle
version: 0.1.0.dev3
authors:
  - name: CoPuzzle contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/AIogry/CoPuzzle
url: https://github.com/AIogry/CoPuzzle
abstract: >-
  CoPuzzle provides finite-state puzzle environments, offline data contracts,
  rule prediction, composition prediction and goal-control evaluation,
  with separately documented physical execution extensions. Benchmark protocol
  versions and frozen artifact hashes are separate from the software version.
keywords:
  - offline reinforcement learning
  - rule induction
  - compositional generalization
  - goal-conditioned control
  - benchmark
